etters. Our goal is to map images from a particular  domain to a Letter that it means. We will be finetuning (transfer learning) existing models that  perform classification on RGB images. We will Look at the levels of RGB images in Particular  Centroidal Pixels and We can Classify from the Centre Which Shape is Defined. We are Planing to  Use RESNET - Residual Neural Networks or Similar to be able to argue and analyze the better  Accuracy between all of the Networks. ","topics":[],"score":222915,"global_rank":180653},{"name":"nikhil16kulkarni/LP3","owner":"nikhil16kulkarni","html_url":"https://github.com/nikhil16kulkarni/LP3","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Jupyter Notebook","description":null,"topics":[],"score":222915,"global_rank":180676},{"name":"Chinmay4285/BankCustomerchurnprediction","owner":"Chinmay4285","html_url":"https://github.com/Chinmay4285/BankCustomerchurnprediction","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Jupyter Notebook","description":"It is a detailed machine learning project that covers various topics like EDA, Feature engineering,Model building and Hyper parameter tuning.","topics":[],"score":222915,"global_rank":180679},{"name":"YanjunLin-Andrie/nba_draft_analysis","owner":"YanjunLin-Andrie","html_url":"https://github.com/YanjunLin-Andrie/nba_draft_analysis","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Jupyter Notebook","description":"Experiments for Project 1","topics":[],"score":222915,"global_rank":180682},{"name":"saurabh111233212/PokeGANs","owner":"saurabh111233212","html_url":"https://github.com/saurabh111233212/PokeGANs","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Jupyter Notebook","description":"Trying to generate Pokemon stats, types, and images from just a name. ","topics":[],"score":222906,"global_rank":180736},{"name":"JY1148/my-dumbbell-curls-coach","owner":"JY1148","html_url":"https://github.com/JY1148/my-dumbbell-curls-coach","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues